<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="">

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear
<span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[BPL Name]</span>,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">**Add
personal introduction**</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank
you for your continued commitment to saving lives. You should feel proud of
your efforts – because of you, many patients will see another tomorrow.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Your
past success at <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[drive]</span>
in <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[month/year]</span> was
inspiring. Your organization collected <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">XXX</span> units! Now let’s discuss the opportunity to
grow our collections and beat our previous record to make an even larger
impact!<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">As
a valued Blood Program Leader, your role as a dedicated partner is so
appreciated. Sponsoring a blood drive is an important community responsibility
and it requires advance planning to ensure success. Your group's participation
will help us reach the daily collection goal that is needed to support the
patients in your community.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The
date(s) listed below has been reserved for your group’s blood drive:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[INCLUDE DATES]</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please
confirm the above dates. Your confirmation will help us effectively plan for
the blood needs of the community. If there is any problem with your dates,
please let me know immediately. Remember to reserve the space for your upcoming
blood drive.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Let’s
focus on booking a blood program that is stronger and better than years before.
Again, thank you for your partnership and support. We could not fulfill our
lifesaving mission without you!<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1">Best regards,</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Name]<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Title]<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Email]</span></p></div>]]></td>
</tr>
